  "name": "betta",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/betta.py): a Siamese fighting fish, a veiltail male, 6.5 cm with its fins -- a SMALL slim body under HUGE FLOWING FINS, each one membrane sheet streaked with rays: the dorsal swept back like a flag, the long-based anal a deep drooping curtain from the belly back under the tail, the great rounded VEIL of a tail (on the tail's bone: it sways), the long thin pelvic STREAMERS, small clear pectorals; a little upturned mouth, a big eye; deep red over rowed scales with an iridescent blue back. A slow SWIMMER (the fish's plumbing; an aquarium fish). Coats: red, royal blue, black orchid, white (opaque).",
